Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that, Ioryogi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's winter for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, definitely winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about that? You warm enough now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What comes after winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You know it's almost spring, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got until spring to fill this bottle with candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry, you're not going to be able to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My silly dad this morning had his tummy sticking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My big brother{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man's out there again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't come in. You don't have anything to complain about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sure would be worried sending my kids to a nursery like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That loan shark again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rikako's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried when she didn't come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. Just send over the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell Rikako goodbye for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rikako's quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's the third one this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is getting to the families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:06:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit making excuses. I told you to deal with it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there's so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. I had plenty left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. Now we'll be able to have a fun Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's great! I want to hang it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto and Kobato are on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka seems so lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's just as kind as normal, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, so lonesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And that as soon as time's up, she's getting shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't care if there's kids around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you don't want someone to get hurt, you'd better clear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is he doing something so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura is Miss Sayaka's husband, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like that means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I'm going to try talking with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can't just have that man out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not someone you can talk things over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I try talking to him, I think he'll understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay out of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Miss Sayaka will be said if anyone else quits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nothing for you to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do anything, okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's the third one this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is getting to the families.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there was anything that could be done, I'm sure Kiyokazu would already have tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know how you feel, but you really shouldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe if I beg him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If this keeps up, Yomogi Nursery won't be here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone will be sad. So I've got to go and talk with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Snow! Let's put snow all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That would be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:32.07,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,White snow everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mister Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hang this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can put a little snowman in the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's Dobato up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.01,0:10:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great weather, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels so good lying in a nice soft bed on days like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Playing, then a soft nap, saying "see you tomorrow" and then all coming back to Yomogi Nursery tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We went on a field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And made pictures from leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Digging for sweet potatoes was fun, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So many people came to the bazaar we just had!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has such fond memories of this nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So please don't shut down Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta pay up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us pay bit by bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, even if you talk to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's right. Talking to me about it won't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll talk with Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He isn't gonna wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he did, there's no way his old man is gonna show any pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving, but I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Don't{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you should give up for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does your stomach hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't just ignore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong!? Are you okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, that's Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Takashi's with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He suddenly collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ambulance went whoo-whoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:13:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'll tell Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The operation's over. He should be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They said not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man you sent to stand out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He had appendicitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's as Chuo Hospital. The surgery went fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Did I trouble you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why not just leave? You're not going to be able to pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't we talk it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so funny!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.83,0:15:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just tell me whether we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, thanks for telling me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should give up and move on, Kiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I even call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I try talking to him, I think he'll understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's okay. He should be back on his feet soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Rikako quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough for today, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there's still cleaning to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today was a busy day. Go home and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be busy setting up for the Christmas party tomorrow, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's leave it for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for helping out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not even one more candy today. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But at least that man will be healthy again soon. Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's no excuse! When he gets better he'll just come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, you're{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto was mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He told me not to do anything, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't do anything wrong, Kobato. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I sit down, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without Yomogi Nursery, everyone will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You always worry about the people around you, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:20:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kind, direct, and always enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I like girls like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That really cheered me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you... Do you want to spend Christmas together?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you just get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Tell me if you need anything else for the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for lending me your muffler!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{ed}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.99,0:01:03.87,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.87,0:01:12.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.17,0:01:21.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.47,0:01:27.77,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.77,0:01:35.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.53,0:01:41.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.20,0:01:46.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.71,0:01:58.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.38,0:02:05.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.10,0:02:13.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.53,0:02:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Warmth in a Chill Wind.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.64,0:23:07.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.49,0:23:15.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.91,0:23:23.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.92,0:23:31.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.30,0:23:42.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.23,0:23:54.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:54.12,0:24:01.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.00,0:24:10.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.60,0:24:28.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.02,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... White Christmas.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.02,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
